{"seq":3,"slug":"philanthropy","title":"慈善","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/philanthropy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-giving-pledge","title":"捐赠誓言","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/philanthropy/the-giving-pledge","wordCount":1362,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-great-giveaway","title":"伟大的捐赠","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/philanthropy/the-great-giveaway","wordCount":1344,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 慈善\n\n在财富之外，巴菲特的慈善之举是他最崇高的代表作。本章考察这一壮举。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"捐赠誓言\"——他发起的、号召全球富豪回馈社会的历史性倡议。第二篇文档讲述\"伟大的捐赠\",呈现他把毕生财富几乎悉数捐献的崇高之举与财富观。\n"}